{"overview":"روایت مختار یک سریال حماسی/تاریخی به کارگردانی داوود میرباقری است که بر پایهٔ زندگی المختار ساخته شده. بیش از ۱۴۰ بازیگر در آن حضور دارند. المختار ثقفی، رهبر شیعه‌ای بود که در سال ۶۸۶ میلادی در شهر کوفه، جنبشی شورشی برای انتقام شهادت حسین (نوهٔ پیامبر اسلام محمد) راه‌اندازی کرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Mokhtar Narrative is an Epic/History television series directed by Davood Mirbagheri, based on the life of Al-Mokhtar. Over 140 actors were cast in it.  Mokhtar Saqafi was a Shiite Muslim leader who sets up a rebellion movement in 686 A.D in the town of Kufa to avenge the martyrdom of Hussain (grandson of Islamic Prophet Muhammad).","tagline_en":"","runtime":60,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":40,"y":2010,"poster":""}],"episodes":40,"crew":["داوود میرباقری"],"crew_en":["Davood Mir-Bagheri"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"فریبرز عرب‌نیا","role":"Mokhtar Saqafi","photo":"/ymlrnNTU5OK1TlrpUpxP7YbYgQG.jpg","en":"Fariborz Arabnia"},{"name":"رضا کیانیان","role":"Abdollah ebn Zobair","photo":"/5rkOWocXp5ZEp9jkoDzB3WgCola.jpg","en":"Reza Kianian"},{"name":"فریبا کوثری","role":"Omreh (Mokhtar's Wife)","photo":"/q5eHbRISEYqKyjJwMSfjiSUsWLB.jpg","en":"Fariba Kowsari"},{"name":"مهدی فخیم‌زاده","role":"Omar ebn Saad","photo":"/wEieluwfJ0rYigYcXguLW4PkGuV.jpg","en":"Mehdi Fakhimzadeh"},{"name":"رضا رویگری","role":"Kian Irani","photo":"/dAsuTd733w3kCY28Ry4JMU5APe8.jpg","en":"Reza Rouygari"},{"name":"فرهاد اصلانی","role":"Ebn Ziad","photo":"/uQ7IycFRRlubFQ050JCoB5kvo18.jpg","en":"Farhad Aslani"},{"name":"جعفر دهقان","role":"","photo":"/a5u7QgNpsdfy4QzUITfaypim9ky.jpg","en":"Jafar Dehghan"},{"name":"ژاله علو","role":"Mokhtar's Mother","photo":"/kRlw5FjLnWyT60qA8IlS4xYuCZ2.jpg","en":"Zhale Olov"},{"name":"نسرین مقانلو","role":"Narieh (Mokhtar's Wife)","photo":"/vvptlys4uQw9DJcINlUNFQylqbS.jpg","en":"Nasrin Moghanloo"},{"name":"الهام حمیدی","role":"","photo":"/n9e2oJnGHR3J7edVH8jICYU0mso.jpg","en":"Elham Hamidi"},{"name":"ویشکا آسایش","ro